"Build US-0418 Pulse for release v0.3.3 (docs/features/epic-04-branding-and-desktop.md, docs/releases/0.3.3.md): an app-level LCARS view on the left arm showing every working agent and every file it reads, writes or deletes, live on one canvas circle, fed by a hook observer (file paths kept in the agent adapters) and a chokidar file observer that runs only while an agent runs or an intent or Spec Kit flow is active."
